    {
      "ordinal": 35,
      "label": "coach_teacher_history_trade_02_00",
      "hash64": "6C30F6D69AC9F8B6",
      "text": "确定是用你的[VAR 0x0101(0001)]和\\n我的索财灵来交换吗？[VAR 0x0114(0027)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 6,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0101",
          "args_hex": [
            "0001"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 22,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0027"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 36,
      "label": "coach_teacher_history_trade_02_01",
      "hash64": "6C30F7D69AC9FA69",
      "text": "无法使用初训家不是自己的\\n宝可梦进行交换。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 37,
      "label": "coach_teacher_history_trade_02_02",
      "hash64": "6C30F4D69AC9F550",
      "text": "无法使用稀有宝可梦\\n进行交换。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 38,
      "label": "coach_teacher_history_trade_02_03",
      "hash64": "6C30F5D69AC9F703",
      "text": "无法使用异色宝可梦\\n进行交换。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 39,
      "label": "coach_teacher_history_trade_03_00",
      "hash64": "1484CCCEFE4AD287",
      "text": "……你手上能够行动的\\n宝可梦好像只有１只啊。\\c\\n劝你先带着２只以上同行宝可梦\\n再欣然接受这次交换。[VAR 0x0114(0027)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 22,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 51,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0027"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 40,
      "label": "coach_teacher_history_trade_03_01",
      "hash64": "1484CBCEFE4AD0D4",
      "text": "……变卦在历史上也是常有之事。\\n就让我抱着期待等你吧。[VAR 0x0114(0027)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 27,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0027"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 41,
      "label": "coach_teacher_history_trade_04_00",
      "hash64": "E2DFBAA54511C13C",
      "text": "那就用你所拥有的宝可梦和\\n我所拥有的索财灵\\r\\n来交换吧。[VAR 0x0114(0027)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 21,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 30,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0027"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 42,
      "label": "coach_teacher_history_talkto_00",
      "hash64": "543004C7FA5D7610",
      "text": "一直待在室内的话，\\n我会受不了这新鲜的气味……\\r\\n就当是转换心情，去外面对战吧？[VAR 0x0114(0027)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 23,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 42,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0027"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 43,
      "label": "coach_teacher_history_cancel_00",
      "hash64": "607BA6B2A8502F5B",
      "text": "……没想到你这么没兴致啊。\\n那我一个人去转换心情了。[VAR 0x0114(0027)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 26,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0027"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 44,
      "label": "coach_teacher_history_battlestart_00",
      "hash64": "648B51A4A41DB493",
      "text": "呵呵呵，多么善良的孩子。\\n那我们就奔赴沙场吧。[VAR 0x0114(0027)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 23,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0027"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 45,
      "label": "coach_teacher_history_battlestart_01",
      "hash64": "648B50A4A41DB2E0",
      "text": "[EMPTY 59]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 0,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "BDFF",
          "args_hex": [
            "003B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 46,
      "label": "coach_teacher_history_battleend_win_00_00",
      "hash64": "1473B43FE834A998",
      "text": "……真没想到你这么难对付。\\n看来你一路走的都是王道啊。[VAR 0x0114(0027)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 27,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0027"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 47,
      "label": "coach_teacher_history_battleend_win_00_01",
      "hash64": "1473B53FE834AB4B",
      "text": "如果……能利用你那份实力，\\n那各种各样的遗迹和坟墓……\\r\\n我就都能尽情调查了……不是吗！？[VAR 0x0114(0027)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 27,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 47,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0027"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 48,
      "label": "coach_teacher_history_battleend_win_00_02",
      "hash64": "1473B63FE834ACFE",
      "text": "好……让我逗一逗你，\\n这个饯别礼就赏给你了。[VAR 0x0114(0027)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 22,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0027"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 49,
      "label": "coach_teacher_history_battleend_win_00_03",
      "hash64": "1473B73FE834AEB1",
      "text": "那可是价值极高的东西。\\n你就每晚一边感谢蕾荷老师，\\r\\n一边凝望它吧。[VAR 0x0114(0027)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 25,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 36,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0027"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 50,
      "label": "coach_teacher_history_reward_00",
      "hash64": "129A8A4084F2402C",
      "text": "[EMPTY 59]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 0,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "BDFF",
          "args_hex": [
            "003B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 51,
      "label": "coach_teacher_history_battleend_win_01_00",
      "hash64": "6950EA35D8CC6D29",
      "text": "呵呵呵，你那份实力\\n果然大有用处。\\c\\n这次也赏你诱饵……\\n哦不，我是说赏你饯别礼。[VAR 0x0114(0027)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 17,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 43,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0027"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 52,
      "label": "coach_teacher_history_battleend_win_01_01",
      "hash64": "6950E935D8CC6B76",
      "text": "希望你和蕾荷老师我一同孕育的历史\\n能够成为不可替代的存在。[VAR 0x0114(0027)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 29,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0027"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 53,
      "label": "coach_teacher_history_battleend_lose_00_00",
      "hash64": "DED7809B5C71604B",
      "text": "即使你有实力，一旦傲慢起来，\\n就会被攻其不备导致败北……\\c\\n你难道是想亲自体验\\n历史性的反转剧吗？[VAR 0x0114(0027)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 28,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 51,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0027"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 54,
      "label": "coach_teacher_history_randomtalk_00",
      "hash64": "1E5F9A87D3C01CCA",
      "text": "你能驾驭灾祸之宝了吗？\\c\\n要是想放手的话，\\n可以马上来找我商量哦。[VAR 0x0114(0027)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 11,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 35,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0027"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 55,
      "label": "coach_teacher_history_randomtalk_01",
      "hash64": "1E5F9B87D3C01E7D",
      "text": "你真的进去过\\n帕底亚巨坑吗？\\c\\n如果是真的，那我可要拘留你几天，\\n好把事情盘问个一清二楚……[VAR 0x0114(0027)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 14,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 48,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0027"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 56,
      "label": "coach_teacher_history_randomtalk_02",
      "hash64": "1E5F9887D3C01964",
      "text": "生态巨蛋的确是\\n非常优秀的技术……\\c\\n但我个人对这种缺乏历史，\\n并且被扭曲的自然毫无兴趣。[VAR 0x0114(0027)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 17,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 47,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0027"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 57,
      "label": "coach_teacher_history_randomtalk_03",
      "hash64": "1E5F9987D3C01B17",
      "text": "你的[VAR 0x0101(0001)]\\n确实是很能干。\\r\\n它在我调查遗迹时派上用场了哦。[VAR 0x0114(0027)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 2,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0101",
          "args_hex": [
            "0001"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 14,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 33,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0027"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 58,
      "label": "coach_teacher_history_randomtalk_04",
      "hash64": "1E5F9687D3C015FE",
      "text": "我的兴趣是\\n收集古老的东西。\\c\\n你接手的索财灵以前会\\n向我索要古钱，让我很头痛。[VAR 0x0114(0027)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 14,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 42,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0027"
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
